        "featured": true,
        "thumb": "assets/images/pareidolia/parei-preview.jpg",
        "description": [
            "I was responsible for designing the user interface elements and title screen. I also created various minor assets throughout the game, and one of the soundtracks used in the beginning cutscenes. This game was a school project collaboration between UofT, and OCAD U students for the Level Up Showcase in spring 2025.", 
            "Pareidolia is a first-person horror game inspired by the Bélmez Faces. The game takes place in an “ordinary” suburban home that is slowly being transformed and infected by face-like stains. Players must try and go about their daily routine by finishing chores, all the while trying to ignore the ever-growing presence of the stains that seem to be multiplying by the hour."
        ],
